      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<h3>No Transit Tasks</h3>\n<p>This is a fairly simple mod. Removes transit requirements from stock Tarkov tasks and adjusts those tasks to be doable without said transit.</p>\n<p>Why? Transits are buggy (or disabled on Fika) so these tasks are at best hard to complete or at worst impossible to complete.</p>\n<h3>Install</h3>\n<p>Drag it into your SPT install.</p>\n<h3>Known Issues</h3>\n<p><strong>FIXED</strong> The task step text will still say “Complete in one raid” or something similar. This can be ignored. I might fix this for English eventually, I might not.</p>\n<h3>Planned Features</h3>\n<p>Make it dynamically handle custom tasks and maybe fix the task condition text</p>\n<p>Feel free to buy me an overpriced starbucks flat white - <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/shibdib\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/shibdib</a></p>\n",
